0 0 0-1-1h-6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6"></path><path d="M18 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M8 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586l2.828 2.828A2 2 0 0 1 22 6.828V16a2 2 0 0 1-2.01 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div> <button class="btn btn-bat-primary" aria-controls="example" type="button" tabindex="0" title="Reset view"><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw-icon lucide-rotate-ccw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg></span></button> <button class="btn btn-bat-primary" aria-controls="example" type="button" tabindex="0" title="Switch to inline search"><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rows-3"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path><path d="M3 15h18"></path></svg></span></button> </div></p>
                    <h4>
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-columns3-cog-icon lucide-columns-3-cog"><path d="M10.5 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5.5" /><path d="m14.3 19.6 1-.4" /><path d="M15 3v7.5" /><path d="m15.2 16.9-.9-.3" /><path d="m16.6 21.7.3-.9" /><path d="m16.8 15.3-.4-1" /><path d="m19.1 15.2.3-.9" /><path d="m19.6 21.7-.4-1" /><path d="m20.7 16.8 1-.4" /><path d="m21.7 19.4-.9-.3" /><path d="M9 3v18" /><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3" /></svg></button></span>
                        Column Visibility
                    </h4>
                    <p>Allows you to determine what columns are visible on the table.</p>
                    <h4>
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-save-icon lucide-save"><path d="M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" /><path d="M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7" /><path d="M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7" /></svg></button></span>
                        Save Table State
                    </h4>
                    <p>Allows you to save the state of the table. This includes the pagination, search, column visibility, and more. Table states can be managed in the next button</p>
                    <h4>
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-save-all-icon lucide-save-all"><path d="M10 2v3a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5" /><path d="M18 18v-6a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6" /><path d="M18 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6" /><path d="M8 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586l2.828 2.828A2 2 0 0 1 22 6.828V16a2 2 0 0 1-2.01 2z" /></svg></button></span>
                        Load Table State
                    </h4>
                    <p>Allows you to load table states that you have saved. Table states can also be managed here, such as updating and deleting.</p>
                    <h4>
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw-icon lucide-rotate-ccw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8" /><path d="M3 3v5h5" /></svg></button></span>
                        Reset Table State
                    </h4>
                    <p>Resets the table state to the default. This clears all searchs, pages, column visibility options, and more.</p>
                    <h4>
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layout-list"><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1" /><rect width="7" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1" /><path d="M14 4h7" /><path d="M14 9h4" /><path d="M14 15h7" /><path d="M14 20h4" /></svg></button></span>
                        &
                        <span><button class="btn btn-sm btn-bat-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rows-3"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" /><path d="M3 9h18" /><path d="M3 15h18" /></svg></button></span>
                        Table Search Toggle
                    </h4>
                    <p>Toggles the individual column filters to be the either the dropdown configuration or as another header row. <b>Toggling between these requires a page reload</b>.</p>
                    
